xt solutions together, viewing them by access method, not by the “free” word on the flyer.</p>\n<p>Groq, Gemini, and OpenRouter, which already have complete generated results, each have a test article beforehand. Agnes text also completed the order and rewrite, returning correctly twice, taking 4.264 seconds and 3.446 seconds respectively; By default, the trial phase discount and the image section share the same official website billing instructions. Here are the remaining directories: <strong>entries that did not receive this round of generated results will have their progress indicated</strong>. Data reference date is November 2, 2026.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-recurring-directory-20261102/image-groq-home-2d5bba25db.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/07f321cd61e3451bfdb7ba9e-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/07f321cd61e3451bfdb7ba9e-780.webp 780w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-recurring-directory-20261102/image-groq-home-2d5bba25db.png\" alt=\"Tested platforms already available\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"780\" height=\"910\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>Adding a newly established Agnes text interface</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  &quot;items&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;设备A&quot;,\n      &quot;quantity&quot;: 2,\n      &quot;unit_price&quot;: 1200,\n      &quot;subtotal&quot;: 2400\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;设备B&quot;,\n      &quot;quantity&quot;: 3,\n      &quot;unit_price&quot;: 350,\n      &quot;subtotal&quot;: 1050\n    }\n  ],\n  &quot;shipping&quot;: 80,\n  &quot;discount&quot;: 130,\n  &quot;total&quot;: 3400\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>Agnes text returns to its original form</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-recurring-directory-20261102/image-agnes-conditions-dcff4dc1de.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/f18bece3c375ed02a01f20d3-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/f18bece3c375ed02a01f20d3-769.webp 769w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-recurring-directory-20261102/image-agnes-conditions-dcff4dc1de.png\" alt=\"Agnes Default Trial Condition\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"769\" height=\"394\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>The request model is agnes-2.5-flash, with the text base address <a href=\"https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1\">https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1</a>. The above order contains the full field and is calculated at 3400 yuan; The Chinese rewrite also retains four pieces of information. Another old configuration in Agnes Text 2.0 returns 500, but no answer is found.</p>\n<h2>First, choose which free option you need</h2>\n<p>Designated models at zero price, like stores only offering products with event coupons for free; Cycle quotas, like monthly reissued trial coupons; Password-free services, like public queues where you can queue without a number. They address cost, trial, and access convenience respectively, and cannot add up credit units.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Demand</th>\n<th>Let’s first look at which category</th>\n<th>Priority checks</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Organize small amounts of text every day</td>\n<td>Specify zero price/cycle quota</td>\n<td>Accurate modeling, reset, speed limiting</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Temporary verification scripts</td>\n<td>Password-free/shared queues</td>\n<td>Wait, fail, and output match</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Long-term access to products</td>\n<td>Formal services are permitted for the corresponding purpose</td>\n<td>Quota, permissions, and failure handling</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Specify the model, account limit, and develop the free file</h2>\n<h3>Zhipu Free Text Model (To Be Tested)</h3>\n<p>**Free cycles / Designated zero price. **Pricing list input and output are free; Fixed flow limit to account view.</p>\n<p>Only specify Flash model; FlashX and flagship models are charged separately.</p>\n<p>Models recorded in this edition: GLM-4.7-FLASH, GLM-4-FLASH-250414, GLM-Z1-FLASH.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-接口基础地址\">https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4\n</code></pre>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/start/pricing.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/start/pricing.md\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>Silicon-based flow-free models</h3>\n<p>**Free cycle / Designated zero price. **Free model bill is zero; Fixed rate limit based on specific model.</p>\n<p>After real-name authentication, you can use all free models; You cannot count all images, videos, and audio models on the platform as free.</p>\n<p>In this round of silicon-based requests, the 402 returned is the current account and the specified model, so it cannot be determined that all free models are invalid.</p>\n<p>Test progress: Request sent: This account has returned 402 balance insufficient and no response received.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-接口基础地址\">https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1\n</code></pre>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://docs.siliconflow.cn/docs/userguide/faqs/rate-limit-and-upgradation\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://docs.siliconflow.cn/docs/userguide/faqs/rate-limit-and-upgradation\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/free-api-text-r