title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/platform/pricing/\">View information 1</a>; <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers-ai/models/\">View information 2</a>.</p>\n<h3>iFlytek Spark Lite (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**Cycle free / designated zero price. **HTTP documentation clearly states that the Lite lightweight model supports free use; Unified quota not obtained this period.</p>\n<p>Requires corresponding HTTP permissions and APIPassword; WebSocket authentication cannot be applied.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://www.xfyun.cn/doc/spark/HTTP%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3.html\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://www.xfyun.cn/doc/spark/HTTP%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3.html\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>AMD Token Factory text interface (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**Daily quota for development purposes. **Free development services; Daily limit calculated based on points, reset at 00:00 Beijing time.</p>\n<p>China site open; Does not consume cloud server credits; No resale allowed, not used for production.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-接口基础地址\">https://developer.amd.com.cn/radeon/api/v1\n</code></pre>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://amd-aim.github.io/radeon-cloud-docs/guides/token-factory/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://amd-aim.github.io/radeon-cloud-docs/guides/token-factory/\">View information 1</a>; <a href=\"https://amd-aim.github.io/radeon-cloud-docs/api/rate-limits/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://amd-aim.github.io/radeon-cloud-docs/api/rate-limits/\">View information 2</a>.</p>\n<h3>Vercel AI Gateway Free Points (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**Points awarded for periodic periods. **Each team receives $5 per month for free credits, applicable only to free tier subsets.</p>\n<p>First request to start; After purchasing points, switch to paid tier; monthly free points no longer apply; Other modes cannot be supported by the platform to reverse free credits.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://vercel.com/docs/ai-gateway/pricing\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>Pollinations Classic text (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**No password-free data limits. **No registration; One request per IP address, with at least a 30-second interval.</p>\n<p>Best effort service; Limit return 402 and Retry-After; Results of the same URL may share cache.</p>\n<p>The model recorded in this edition: GPT-OSS 20B.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-接口基础地址\">https://text.pollinations.ai\n</code></pre>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pollinations/pollinations/master/APIDOCS.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pollinations/pollinations/master/APIDOCS.md\">View Information</a>.</p>\n<h3>AI Horde Volunteer Shared Queue (to be tested)</h3>\n<p>**Community shared queues. **Volunteers share computing power, free text and image tasks; Queues and priorities vary with supply.</p>\n<p>Use officially public APIs; Contributions and kudos influence priority; No commitment to fixed wait times or commercial licenses.</p>\n<p>Official portal: <a href=\"https://aihorde.net/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://aihorde.net/\">View information 1</a>; <a href=\"https://aihorde.net/api/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://aihorde.net/api/\">View information 2</a>.</p>\n<h2>Turning directories into usable interfaces—how much step is needed?</h2>\n<p>First, create a key with your own account, select the exact model from the directory, and send a small task with a standard answer; Keep the status code, answer, actual model, and time spent. For example, this order question cost 3400 yuan, and the program can check directly. After mastering chat questions, test your abilities for reading, translation, and other abilities, without counting a single text answer as verified by the entire platform.</p>\n<p>Cloudflare’s Neurons are units of usage calculated by model, more like the power consumed by different appliances; not the number of requests. Vercel’s points are shared wallets; As the number of models increases, wallets don’t add a few more accordingly. Moda’s model file pages and callable interfaces are also different, so you must find an open inference service.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Quote: My judgment</strong>\nFirst, find one entry point from the four tests that have completed similar tasks, then fill in the options according to this directory. Listing newly registered entries one by one at the end saves the time of “saving many addresses but not a single one is actually connected.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Main sources of verification</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/pricing\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://wiki.agnes-ai.com/zh-Hans/docs/pricing\">Agnes Current Price</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.bigmodel.cn/cn/guide/start/pricing.md\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"web